  "notes": "Mistral first presented this version as Mistral 7B Instruct v0.2, a new minor release of Mistral 7B Instruct, served by the mistral-tiny endpoint at the beta launch of la Plateforme on 2023-12-11. The changelog of 2024-02-26 renames mistral-tiny to open-mistral-7b (aka mistral-tiny-2312). The docs and the legal centre give 2023-12-11 for both base and instruct; the base weights are linked from the docs as a tar file on models.mistralcdn.com (not on Hugging Face) whose Last-Modified header read 2024-03-23 when checked on 2026-10-01; no primary source gives a separate release date for the base checkpoint. API deprecation and retirement dates are shared with the other open-mistral-7b versions."
